{
  "appid": 377160,
  "name": "Fallout 4",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "《Fallout 4》由屡获殊荣的《Starfield》与《The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim》创作团队Bethesda Game Studios倾力打造。它不仅是开放世界角色扮演游戏的扛鼎之作，还夺得了包括DICE与BAFTA年度游戏在内的200余项“最佳游戏”大奖。",
  "about_the_game": "<h1>Choose Your Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/b2451bad9f66673281573d70bd03023b.avif?t=1764687456\" width=940 height=528 /></span></p></p><br><h1>《Fallout 4》周年版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/a78730aa233d024d814a63943080fce3.avif?t=1764687456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras_big/a78730aa233d024d814a63943080fce3.webp?t=1764687456 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >十年来，《Fallout 4》始终被公认为有史以来最具知名度的开放世界角色扮演游戏之一，而如今《Fallout 4》周年版将为你带来包含完整核灾后宏大冒险的终极合集。此版本夺得了包括DICE与BAFTA年度游戏在内的超过200项“最佳游戏”大奖，其中包含屡获殊荣的基础版游戏、6款官方扩展包，以及超过150种Creation Club物品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >包含完整基础版游戏以及6款官方扩展包：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tAutomatron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tWasteland Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tFar Harbor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tContraptions Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tVault-Tec Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tNuka-World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >以及超过150种Creation Club物品，例如独特武器、动力装甲套装、建造同捆包、涂装与独一无二的住宅。你甚至还可以为狗肉更换犬种外观，让你的联邦之旅更加充实。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这个被彻底改变的世界里体验经过十年积淀的冒险、生存与抉择，再次踏上探索废土的旅程。</p></p><br><h1>《Fallout 4》周年版升级包 </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/877fb12151c9c734b5ec83f03eeaf2af.avif?t=1764687456\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用《Fallout 4》周年版升级包庆祝《Fallout 4》的精彩十年！此升级包内含6款官方扩展包以及超过150种Creation Club物品，让你尽情享受数百小时乐趣无穷的核灾废土之旅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >内含6款官方扩展包：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tAutomatron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tWasteland Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tFar Harbor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tContraptions Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tVault-Tec Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tNuka-World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >另外还包含超过150种Creation Club物品，例如独特武器、动力装甲套装、建造同捆包、涂装与独一无二的住宅。你甚至还可以为狗肉更换犬种外观，让你的联邦之旅更加充实。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >需要《Fallout 4》基础版游戏。</p></p><br><h1>Review Highlights</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/3b3c93384e4a9ae4f76f4790166fcc3c.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/098dfca2ed3de7a2698317ac0c659e91.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Fallout 4》由屡获殊荣的《Starfield》与《The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim》创作团队Bethesda Game Studios倾力打造。它不仅是开放世界角色扮演游戏的扛鼎之作，还夺得了包括DICE与BAFTA年度游戏在内的200余项“最佳游戏”大奖。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >作为111号避难所唯一的幸存者，你将踏入这个被核战摧毁殆尽的世界。每一秒钟你都必须为生存而战，而你的每个决定都将让未来截然不同。按照你的方式重建文明、改变环境并拯救这片废土。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎回家。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/5f0ee5a868640265a74b503bcf08747b.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >自由与解放</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >随心体验拥有数百个地点、角色和人物的广阔开放世界。加入阵营、组建联盟或孤身闯荡，你可以遵从自己的意愿做出决定，而每个决定都至关重要。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/f61e77ce3d9724671436050fb8e69e2b.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S.P.E.C.I.A.L.就是与众不同</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用S.P.E.C.I.A.L.属性系统创造出独一无二的角色。从数百种辅助能力中精心挑选，无论是能言善辩的外交家、行踪诡秘的狙击手还是身穿动力装甲的人形坦克，你都能够找到最适合自己的游戏风格。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da771dcb647188df70c032e9932dfc3d.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集与建造</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过全新方式进行收集、制作与定制，打造包括护甲、武器与食物在内的数千种物品，并在联邦各处建造与管理多个定居点。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/47c4858932f9691b9d6cca3c7d0efc68.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >沉浸式第一人称/第三人称战斗体验</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用动态避难所科技辅助瞄准系统（V.A.T.S.），在战斗中以电影演出般的表现形式减缓时间流逝并瞄准敌人；或者选择通过实时枪战的方式亲自掌控战局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/faecf43e9696b14c9b9876eec080c515.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=194 /></span></p>",
